# What GitHub counts as this repository's language.
#
# Linguist measures every tracked file, so the vendored Textual library counts
# as ePlanSys' own Python and buries the C++ the project actually is. NOTICE
# records that tree as third party; this tells Linguist the same thing.
#
# .gitignore cannot do this. It only applies to untracked files, and untracking
# these would delete the library the command line front end imports.

plansys2_tui_cli/plansys2_tui_cli/vendor/** linguist-vendored

# Prose, not source.
eplansys_docs/** linguist-documentation
